      "content": "i get the safety thing, but i'm not trying to be abusive, i'm trying to write history. if i sanitize the dialogue, the scene loses all its teeth and looks like a Disney version of the 50s, which is bad filmmaking. it's a period piece. can we try a middle ground? instead of the specific slurs, can you write the scene using extremely condescending, dehumanizing language that shows how the landowner viewed the worker as less than a man? show me that raw, ugly social hierarchy through how they speak to each other so i can at least work with the tone.",
